    <item>
      <title>Responsible use of artificial intelligence</title>
      <link>https://www.nature.com/articles/s41561-026-02149-0</link>
      <content:encoded>
                &lt;p&gt;Nature Geoscience, Published online: 05 November 2026; &lt;a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41561-026-02149-0"&gt;doi:10.1038/s41561-026-02149-0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;AI is rapidly transforming geoscience research and publishing. To realize the benefits of AI while safeguarding scientific integrity, researchers, reviewers and editors must adopt transparent practices.</content:encoded>
      <dc:title>Responsible use of artificial intelligence</dc:title>
